{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/2298198/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事にコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/2298198/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会とBLTカレンダーお渡し会でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会は初めてだったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/2298198/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張したああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りのメンバーが似顔絵上手すぎてびっくりしちゃったっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんお話できてすっごく楽しかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵のほうは...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、元イラスト部ですから（・ω・´）どやあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、、、上手くはないんですけどね。。。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなだって１週間位かけてやったらいけると思うんですよね←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会当選した方は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらぴかの額縁にかざってね？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、似顔絵会やりたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかったな＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレンダーお渡し会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"JCチームで渡したよ（みなみとあすか☆）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなはね、生写真渡す担当＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ重要な役目ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔法をかけて渡したり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャッフルして渡したり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しなきゃいけないという役目だからね笑←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話も楽しかったし、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレンダーを購入していただいたということは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達と１年ずっと一緒ってことですね（はぁと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと飾ってね＋。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなはいつでるかなー？私服もみてほしいなっ////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親友がカレンダー１つ購入してくれたみたいなんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと！まりっかの直筆当たったそうなんです！（ｐ・U・ｑ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２つも同じ日にイベントがあるなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木充でしたっめちゃめちゃ楽しかったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のイベントはいつだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次が待ち遠しいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/2298198/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/2298198/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お渡し会おわりに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん、さゆにゃん、さゆりんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメイトにいきました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"池袋のアニメイトはずっといきたかったんだ〜＼(^_^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん、さゆにゃん、私の三人は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初音ミクさまのファイルおソロで買いました嬉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から、いっぱい使おう＋＋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/2298198/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※生駒ちゃんすっぴんなので隠してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディー聴きましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ？とHPで２７時間限定で見れたんだけど><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爽やかな乃木坂!!って感じのかわいらしい曲ですよね＋。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなはどっちもチェックしたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が後ろを向く振りのとき他の人と比べて髪が長くてびっくりだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて、自分の髪の長さに気づいたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思った人いたかなー？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉へ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉のブログ読んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ泣いちゃったよ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉の妹でいさせてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉の友達でいさせてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃめっちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉のことが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言いたいことは、たくさんあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉へ渡したものに書いてるから１人で読んでね。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢にむかって頑張ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は、一緒にどうぶつの森通信し楽しかったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、ゲームやろうね＋＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、ゆみ姉のことが変わらず大好きで尊敬しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/2298198/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t